    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math to be a bit intimidating, especially compared to subjects like history or art that feel more intuitive. As a vocational student, I’ve had to use basic math in practical applications, but I don’t see myself as naturally gifted in it. I view math as a tool, not a passion, and I try to approach it with patience rather than pressure.",
