    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a simple AI tutor app to practice algebra problems. It was helpful for checking my work and giving instant feedback. However, I found it repetitive and sometimes too rigid. It didn’t explain concepts deeply, so I had to supplement it with textbooks and my own notes. Still, it saved time when I was stuck on routine problems.",
